{"Version":1,"ProgramText":"SCREEN 640,480\nPRINTG \u0022HEJ\u0022\n\nINKG Red\nBox 200,200,400,400\n\n\nINKG Green\nFILL 201,201\n\nINKG Blue\nCIRCLE 100,100,100\n\nINKG Yellow\nCIRCLEF 200,100,100,50\n\nINKG WHITE\nFOR I = 0 TO 480\n   LINE 0,0,640,I\n   WAIT 2\nNEXT I\n\nFOR I = 640 TO 0 STEP -1\n   LINE 0,0,I,480\n   WAIT 2\nNEXT I\n\nCLSG","ScreenWidth":640,"ScreenHeight":480,"Sprites":[],"MapWidth":1,"MapHeight":1,"MapData":[-1]}